{"id":"661795","name":"快炒猪肝","author":"美食家3998N_bkoa","authorId":"13061039","desc":"","cover":"images/661795/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪肝","amount":"500克"}],"sub":[{"name":"水","amount":"500毫升"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪肝卖回来切成小薄片清洗干净。","img":"images/661795/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加胡椒粉和姜粉腌制10分钟。","img":"images/661795/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"干辣椒祘姜放在小碗里。","img":"images/661795/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"料酒倒入小碗盘备用.","img":"images/661795/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅里倒入油烧热。","img":"images/661795/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"下入碗料及猪肝快速翻炒。","img":"images/661795/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"分钟后即可关火。","img":"images/661795/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"装盘(成品图)。","img":"images/661795/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"炒猪肝配一碗大米饭香。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}